></mtr></mtable></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable></semantics></math></div>\n\t\t\tPhương trình này có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Δ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math> nên có hai nghiệm. Theo định lý Viète tích hai nghiệm bằng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>5</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></semantics></math>.</li><li>Đúng.<br>Với <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></semantics></math> thì <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></semantics></math> nên điểm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>;</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> không thuộc trục <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Lại có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mi>′</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>4</mn><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math> nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mi>′</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math>. Do đó tiếp tuyến của <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> tại <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>;</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> song song với trục hoành.</li><li>Đúng.<br>Đặt <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>4</mn><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.\n\t\t\tTa có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>′</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>4</mn><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>. <br>Gọi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>;</mo><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> là tọa độ tiếp điểm. <br>Hệ số góc của tiếp tuyến tại điểm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>;</mo><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mi>′</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>. <br>Vì tiếp tuyến song song với đường thẳng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></semantics></math> nên \n\t\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mi>′</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>⇔</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mn>4</mn><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>−</mo><mn>24</mn><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>32</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>≠</mo><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow><mo>⇔</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-a